
Title:-

ENDPOINT SECURITY MONITORING USING WINDOWS DEFENDER

1. Introduction

Nowadays computers, laptops, and other electronics are threatened by numerous amounts of various cyberattacks such as viruses, malware, spyware, ransomware, and other malicious software. Thus, the process of securing the endpoint device is vital to cybersecurity.

Microsoft Windows has a built system, Windows Security, with Microsoft Defender Antivirus which ensures the protection of the computer by scanning files and programs, providing real-time protection features, detecting threats, and conducting virus scans.


2. Aim

